// StealthSend.compact — shielded stealth payment + announcement append (API sketch).
//
// Public inputs (example): commitment to payment, nullifiers, anchor — follow Zswap patterns.
// Private inputs:
//   - stealth_addr (derived off-chain per DKSAP)
//   - amount, token identifier
//   - R (ephemeral pubkey), ciphertext / viewTag
//
// Actions:
//   1. mintShieldedToken(/* owner = stealth spending condition */, amount, token)
//      — amounts + asset types hidden in Zswap UTXOs.
//   2. Append to AnnouncementLog private state:
//        { stealthAddress, R, viewTag, ciphertext }
//
// No public `log` for (R, stealthAddress): Midnight private ledger carries it; scanning is witness-side.
